I walk over to court three.
I have the racket in my hand.
There are two people standing on the court.
It is a man and a woman.
I walk over to them.
"Hi, my name is Maya," I say.
"Welcome, Maya," the man says.
"My name is Kasper, and this is Sara."
Sara smiles at me.
"Are you new here?" Sara asks.
"Yes, it is my first time here," I answer.
"I would like to learn to play."
"We need a player," Kasper says.
"Do you want to play a game with us?"
"Yes please," I say.
I really like to meet new people.
Kasper and Sara are very friendly.
We get ready on the court.
I am ready to play.
